          "contents": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n  <head>\n    <title>Pandas</title>\n    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\" />\n  </head>\n  <body>\n    <h1>Pandas</h1>\n    <p>Pandas are bears that live in the mountain forests of China.</p>\n    <p>They have black and white fur.</p>\n    <h2>Panda Facts</h2>\n    <ul>\n      <li>Pandas eat bamboo.</li>\n      <li>Pandas can eat for up to 14 hours a day.</li>\n      <li>Baby pandas are very small when they are born.</li>\n    </ul>\n    <button>Learn More</button>\n  </body>\n</html>\n",
