    "long_instructions": "Someone named Sam wrote this prompt for a panda fan page:\n\n*“Make a website about pandas.”*\n\nLook at the preview to see what it built. Sam is not happy with it.\n\n*Then:*\n\nPick one thing you’d change. Then write a better prompt for Sam. Name the part you’re changing and add at least two details, like a color, a tone, or something pandas do."
